✅ MERGE (10 Questions)
===========================
--syntax
MERGE target_table AS t
USING source_table AS s
ON t.id = s.id

WHEN MATCHED THEN
UPDATE SET ...

WHEN NOT MATCHED THEN
INSERT (...)

WHEN NOT MATCHED BY SOURCE THEN
DELETE;

1.Merge cust_new into cust by matching cid.

  merge cust as c
  using new_cust as cn
  on c.cid=cn.cid

2.Update salary in cust if the matching customer exists in cust_new.
  
  merge cust as c
  using cust_new as cn
  on c.cid=cn.cid
  when matched then
  update set c.salary=cn.salary

3.Insert new customers from cust_new if they dont exist in cust.
    
